        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-613404"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <blockquote><p>We’ve already shipped DP1 without a lot of intermediates that people would similarly <em>like</em> to have, and we’re going to be doing the same for DP2.</p></blockquote>

<p>Correct, and that is OK, because DP2, like DP1 is a shared-risk <em>preview.</em> Through these previews we learn which intermediates are of actually useful. </p>
        </td></tr>
