        <tr id="comment-body-616316"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6" class="user-hover" rel="712020:34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6" data-account-id="712020:34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6" accountid="712020:34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6" rel="noreferrer">Hsin-Fang Chiang</a>  can you update the original text of the RFC to state where we are now ?  We will return to this after the break in January.</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-620555"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6"
                id="word_commented_712020:34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6"
                href="https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6">
