                    Jim Bosch
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">08/Jan/26</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-620774"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>I'd say no: for science users those are superseded by the SDM schemas.</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-621819"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:20ad3b56-9b88-4b76-bb4e-576e831f79ae"
                id="word_commented_557058:20ad3b56-9b88-4b76-bb4e-576e831f79ae"
