                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">12/Jan/26</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-621819"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6" class="user-hover" rel="712020:34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6" data-account-id="712020:34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6" accountid="712020:34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6" rel="noreferrer">Hsin-Fang Chiang</a> CCB agrees to all but <b>template_detector</b> - this can be reproduced with a library/service call (admittedly the short routine like many others does not exist yet) but it will . If  <b>template_detector</b>  is removed we can board recommend</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-621821"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:34995da4-22f6-4b5f-9b25-34bff6b9b0e6"
