            [
                <font color="#336699">15/Jan/26</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-622842"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Raising the prospect that we should not enforce 30-day delete until a recreation service is available and/or DR1 is out</p>

<p>cc: <a href="https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A5afef4b4-f1bc-4238-977f-9f8d3183e55c" class="user-hover" rel="557058:5afef4b4-f1bc-4238-977f-9f8d3183e55c" data-account-id="557058:5afef4b4-f1bc-4238-977f-9f8d3183e55c" accountid="557058:5afef4b4-f1bc-4238-977f-9f8d3183e55c" rel="noreferrer">Gregory Dubois-Felsmann</a> </p>
