        <tr id="comment-body-624817"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>👍  to <tt>preliminary_visit_summary</tt>.  But why a (presumably afw.table/FITS) <tt>_footprints</tt> catalog instead of an SDM-standardized Parquet variant?</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-624819"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:b2e80694-0bc8-49fc-80b3-03ed86d92438"
