                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">24/Jan/26</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-624934"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>I think we do need to make a standardized catalog with an official schema for any public table dataset.  I imagine this can be done with just a slight reconfiguration of the DRP source-transform and -consolidate tasks.</p>

<p>I also think we should just this standardized visit-level dataset <tt>source</tt>, as it is pretty analogous to the DRP <tt>source</tt> (and then rename its predecessors accordingly).  If we want to clarify that it’s not as fully calibrated as the DRP <tt>source</tt>, maybe <tt>ap_source</tt> or <tt>nightly_source</tt>?</p>
        </td></tr>
