            <p><a href="https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=63764f019960988ef6bcba0e" class="user-hover" rel="63764f019960988ef6bcba0e" data-account-id="63764f019960988ef6bcba0e" accountid="63764f019960988ef6bcba0e" rel="noreferrer">Leanne Guy</a> <a href="https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A75b6608f-df26-4775-a93d-f50ab790c78d" class="user-hover" rel="712020:75b6608f-df26-4775-a93d-f50ab790c78d" data-account-id="712020:75b6608f-df26-4775-a93d-f50ab790c78d" accountid="712020:75b6608f-df26-4775-a93d-f50ab790c78d" rel="noreferrer">Adam Bolton</a> we need to discuss the footprint - do we need <tt>single_visit_star_reprocessed_footprints</tt> as opposed to a MOC ? otherwise we need to find 2PB .. </p>
