        <tr id="comment-body-625460"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>From the butler database-sizing perspective I like per-visit better, but I’m not familiar with the RSP preference.</p>

<p>I do think we should call it <tt>ap_source</tt> (no <tt>_detector</tt>) either way; the public dataset type should the short name, while suffix modifiers are only for intermediates.</p>
        </td></tr>
