        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-625517"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A20ad3b56-9b88-4b76-bb4e-576e831f79ae" class="user-hover" rel="557058:20ad3b56-9b88-4b76-bb4e-576e831f79ae" data-account-id="557058:20ad3b56-9b88-4b76-bb4e-576e831f79ae" accountid="557058:20ad3b56-9b88-4b76-bb4e-576e831f79ae" rel="noreferrer">William O'Mullane</a> Can you explain this comment more?  What do you mean by a “star footprint” in this context?  We use “footprint” with a lot of different meanings.</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-625518"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:5afef4b4-f1bc-4238-977f-9f8d3183e55c"
