        <tr id="comment-body-625525"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A1624b468-e862-4644-aaf5-3bd8197af8ab" class="user-hover" rel="557058:1624b468-e862-4644-aaf5-3bd8197af8ab" data-account-id="557058:1624b468-e862-4644-aaf5-3bd8197af8ab" accountid="557058:1624b468-e862-4644-aaf5-3bd8197af8ab" rel="noreferrer">Kian-Tat Lim</a> is correct, the final catalog will not contain footprints. The <tt>single_visit_star_reprocessed_footprints</tt> catalog is a placeholder until we define and start creating a new, standardized, catalog.</p>
