        <tr id="comment-body-625536"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>The description has been updated. The new proposal is to store and publish a new type <tt>ap_source</tt>   instead of  <tt>single_visit_star_reprocessed_footprints</tt> .  Then the overall size addition is relatively small.  <a href="https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/DM-53937" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/DM-53937</a> is the ticket to add a new pipeline for it. </p>
