        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-626875"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Thanks to <a href="https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=63e809f7db4f715c97259960" class="user-hover" rel="63e809f7db4f715c97259960" data-account-id="63e809f7db4f715c97259960" accountid="63e809f7db4f715c97259960" rel="noreferrer">Tim Jenness</a>  bringing up the RTN-011 timeline at Slack. </p>

<p>The thinking that there is about 1 year between survey start and DR1 is outdated. That was true with RTN-011 v6.2 where 6-month DR1 was expected in Sep 2026 and DR2 expected in Sep 2027.  But v7.0 from last Nov has changed to 1yr DR1 at Oct 2027. And the current v7.3 put DR1 at Feb 2028. </p>

<p>I will update the description and use 2yr as the baseline estimate. </p>

<p>TLDR: Consider 4PB o f Tier 1 instead of 2PB.  </p>
        </td></tr>
            </table>
